# Image CVEs accepted as a known risk. .github/scripts/trivy-image.sh reads this
# file for the PR image check, the release gate and the weekly scan: a listed CVE
# is left out of their reports and does not fail the gate.
#
# Only fixable CRITICAL findings fail the gate, so list a CVE here only when it
# cannot be fixed by updating the image. Put the reason on the line above it and
# an expiry date after the id; the CVE counts again from that date.
#
#   # Reachable only through <component>, which this image does not run.
#   CVE-2026-12345 exp:2026-12-31
